graph TD
    A[Error Occurs] --> B{Error Source?}

    B -->|Connection| C[Connection Error]
    B -->|Publishing| D[Publish Error]
    B -->|Subscription| E[Subscription Error]
    B -->|Unknown| F[Generic Error]

    C --> G{Error Type}
    G -->|Timeout| H[Connection Timeout]
    G -->|Refused| I[Connection Refused]
    G -->|Disconnected| J[Relay Disconnected]
    G -->|Network| K[Network Error]

    D --> L{Error Type}
    L -->|Validation| M[Event Validation Failed]
    L -->|Rate Limit| N[Rate Limit Exceeded]
    L -->|Relay Rejected| O[Relay Rejected Event]
    L -->|Timeout| P[Publish Timeout]

    E --> Q{Error Type}
    Q -->|Filter Invalid| R[Filter Validation Error]
    Q -->|Timeout| S[Subscription Timeout]
    Q -->|No Relays| T[No Active Relays]
    Q -->|EOSE Failed| U[EOSE Not Received]

    H --> V{Severity Classification}
    I --> V
    J --> V
    K --> V
    M --> V
    N --> V
    O --> V
    P --> V
    R --> V
    S --> V
    T --> V
    U --> V
    F --> V

    V -->|Low Impact| W[INFO Toast]
    V -->|Medium Impact| X[WARNING Toast]
    V -->|High Impact| Y[ERROR Toast]
    V -->|Critical Impact| Z[CRITICAL Toast + Alert]

    W --> AA[Auto-dismiss 3s]
    X --> AB[Auto-dismiss 5s]
    Y --> AC[Auto-dismiss 7s + Retry]
    Z --> AD[Manual Dismiss + Retry]

    subgraph "Error Metadata"
        AE[Error Code]
        AF[Error Message]
        AG[Troubleshooting Hints]
        AH[Retry Strategy]
        AI[Affected Resources]
    end

    V --> AE
    V --> AF
    V --> AG
    V --> AH
    V --> AI

    style V fill:#ff6b6b
    style W fill:#6bcf7f
    style X fill:#ffd93d
    style Y fill:#ff9f43
    style Z fill:#d63031
